  - q: "How much does SEO cost in Utah?"
    a: "Our Utah SEO services start at $1,500/month for local businesses and scale based on market competitiveness and scope. We offer flexible packages that include technical SEO, local optimization, content strategy, and reporting. Most clients see meaningful results within 3-6 months."
  - q: "How long does SEO take to show results?"
    a: "SEO is a long-term investment. Local businesses typically see measurable improvements in 3-4 months — appearing in Google map packs, ranking for long-tail keywords, and generating organic leads. Highly competitive markets may take 6-9 months to see top rankings. We focus on quick wins first while building toward sustainable growth."
  - q: "What is the difference between SEO and AEO?"
    a: "SEO optimizes your site to rank in Google search results. AEO (Answer Engine Optimization) optimizes your content to be cited by AI tools like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews. Both are critical. SEO captures traditional search traffic. AEO captures the growing segment of users who rely on AI for recommendations."
  - q: "Do you require long-term contracts?"
